      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm looking into a zoning reclassification issue in Austin. We have a client trying to move a parcel from R-1 to a mixed-use designation, but we've hit a snag with the setback requirements and some existing encroachment issues from a neighboring commercial structure. The municipal code seems to have some conflicting language regarding how these encroachments affect the ability to grant a variance. How should I approach a legal analysis of these conflicting clauses?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
